{"seq":2,"slug":"a-mathematical-theory-of-communication","title":"《通信的数学理论》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/founding-information-theory/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication","wordCount":1778,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"通信的数学理论\">《通信的数学理论》</h1><p>一九四八年，《贝尔系统技术杂志》（Bell System Technical Journal）第 27 卷分两期刊出了一篇署名 C. E. Shannon、题为《通信的数学理论》（A Mathematical Theory of Communication）的长文（pp. 379–423 与 pp. 623–656）。次年它与韦弗（Warren Weaver）的导读合为单行本《The Mathematical Theory of Communication》出版——注意定冠词从「A」变成了「The」，这个微小改动恰好记录了它如何在一年间从「一种理论」变成「那个理论」。</p>\n<p>本篇是对这篇论文<strong>作为文本与结构</strong>的拆解：它由哪几块组成、各块解决什么、彼此如何咬合。称号与历史定位见姊妹篇 <a href=\"the-father-of-information-theory\">信息论之父</a>；论文作为「代表作」的版本流传与评价，则在 <a href=\"../../major-works/the-1948-paper/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication\">代表作·一九四八年论文</a> 展开，本篇不重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这篇论文之所以成为理论，靠的是三件东西的咬合：<strong>一张通用通信模型</strong>（信源→编码→信道→解码→信宿，噪声注入信道）、<strong>一个度量信息量的量</strong>（熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H=-\\sum p_i\\log p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）、<strong>两条极限定理</strong>（信源编码定理给出可压缩下限，有噪信道编码定理给出可靠传输上限）。下限与上限之间，就是工程可以驰骋的全部空间。理解了这条「先定尺、再求两个极限」的骨架，就理解了整套理论的组织方式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一张图-通信系统的通用模型\">一张图：通信系统的通用模型</h2><p>论文开篇给出的通信系统框图，是它最被反复引用的部分。香农把任何通信——电报、电话、电视乃至 DNA 转录——都抽象成同一条链路：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    S[信源 Source] --&gt; T[发射器/编码器 Transmitter]&#10;    T --&gt; CH[信道 Channel]&#10;    N[噪声源 Noise] --&gt; CH&#10;    CH --&gt; R[接收器/解码器 Receiver]&#10;    R --&gt; D[信宿 Destination]\">graph LR\n    S[信源 Source] --&gt; T[发射器/编码器 Transmitter]\n    T --&gt; CH[信道 Channel]\n    N[噪声源 Noise] --&gt; CH\n    CH --&gt; R[接收器/解码器 Receiver]\n    R --&gt; D[信宿 Destination]</pre><p>这张图的力量在于「通用」：它不关心传的是文字还是图像，只关心「消息从信源的一组可能性中被选出，经过会被噪声污染的信道，到达信宿」。正是这种刻意的抽象，让一套数学能同时适用于一切媒介。模型背后的方法论（剥离意义）见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/the-power-of-abstraction/separating-information-from-meaning\">思想方法·把信息与意义分离</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"论文的四块骨架\">论文的四块骨架</h2><p>论文逻辑严密，可拆为四个递进的部分。理解了这四块的咬合关系，就理解了整套理论：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部分</th>\n<th>核心问题</th>\n<th>关键结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>离散无噪信源</td>\n<td>信息怎么度量？</td>\n<td>熵 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H=-\\sum p_i \\log p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离散信源编码</td>\n<td>无噪时最少要多少比特？</td>\n<td>无失真编码定理：极限即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>离散有噪信道</td>\n<td>有噪时最多能传多快？</td>\n<td>信道容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 与有噪信道编码定理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续信源/信道</td>\n<td>带宽受限、含高斯噪声时？</td>\n<td>香农-哈特利公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C=B\\log_2(1+S/N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四块之间是「先定尺、再求两个极限」的关系：先用熵给信息定一把尺（第一、二块给出可压缩的<strong>下限</strong>），再用容量给信道定一条线（第三、四块给出可传输的<strong>上限</strong>）。下限与上限之间，就是工程可以驰骋的全部空间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两条定理-下限与上限\">两条定理：下限与上限</h2><p>论文最硬核的成果是两条「极限定理」，它们至今仍是数字通信的两块界碑：</p>\n<p><strong>信源编码定理（下限）</strong>：一个熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的信源，平均每符号的无失真编码长度不可能小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 比特，且可以任意逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span>。这给「数据压缩到底能压多狠」划了一条不可逾越的底线——ZIP、JPEG、H.265 都在这条线之上工作。</p>\n<p><strong>有噪信道编码定理（上限）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>error</mtext></msub><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>R</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>C</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟹</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>error</mtext></msub><mo>↛</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R &lt; C \\implies P_{\\text{error}} \\to 0, \\qquad R &gt; C \\implies P_{\\text{error}} \\not\\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">error</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟹</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">error</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只要速率低于容量，就能编码到几乎不出错；一旦越过容量，可靠传输便不可能。这条「全有或全无」的相变式结论，是论文最反直觉、也最深远的一击。两条定理的细节分别见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/channels-and-coding/reliable-communication\">思想方法·可靠通信</a> 与 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/channels-and-coding/channel-capacity\">信道容量</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个数字例子-英语的熵\">一个数字例子：英语的熵</h2><p>论文不只是抽象定理，香农还亲手算了实例。他估计英文文本的熵约为每字母 1.0–1.5 比特（考虑长程相关性后更低），而 26 个字母加空格若等概率则需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mn>27</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>4.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log_2 27 \\approx 4.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">27</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.75</span></span></span></span></span> 比特/字母。两者之差，正是英语的「冗余」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>冗余率</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>1.3</mn><mn>4.75</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>73</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{冗余率} \\approx 1 - \\frac{1.3}{4.75} \\approx 73\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">冗余率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4.75</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">73%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着英文约四分之三的篇幅在原则上可被压缩掉——这正是为什么我们能把文本压成原大小的零头，也是为什么填字游戏能玩得通（少几个字母仍可还原）。这个例子第一次把「冗余」这个含糊的修辞概念，变成了一个能算出来的百分比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何是-划时代-一篇论文的杠杆\">为何是「划时代」：一篇论文的杠杆</h2><p>把这篇论文放回科学史，它的特殊性在于「框架完整度」与「后续杠杆」之比异常之高：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>完整度</strong>：度量、编码下限、传输上限、连续情形一次给齐，少有学科奠基论文如此自足。</li>\n<li><strong>杠杆</strong>：它催生的不止一个领域。数据压缩、纠错编码、密码学（香农 1949 年《保密系统的通信理论》是其姊妹篇）、乃至机器学习中的交叉熵，都直接生长于此。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>权衡同样要诚实：论文的强大来自「剥离语义」，因此它<strong>不</strong>回答「信息是否有意义、是否为真」。韦弗在导读中区分了通信的「技术层、语义层、效用层」，并指出香农只攻克了技术层——这既是它普适的根源，也是它谦逊的边界。把这篇论文误读为「关于意义的理论」，是最常见的越界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与定位\">反模式与定位</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>当作万能钥匙</strong>：信息论度量的是「不确定性的消除」，不是「价值」。一条全是随机噪声的串熵最高，却毫无用处——熵高 ≠ 有用，这是初学者最易踩的坑。</li>\n<li><strong>跳过框图直奔公式</strong>：脱离了那张通用通信模型，熵与容量会变成两个孤立公式；正是框图把它们组织成了一个理论。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话定位：《通信的数学理论》之所以是二十世纪最重要的科学论文之一，不在于篇幅或辞藻，而在于它用一张框图、一个量（熵）、两条定理，把通信工程从「试错的手艺」变成了「有极限、可证明的科学」。</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>延伸</strong>：姊妹篇 <a href=\"the-father-of-information-theory\">信息论之父</a>｜熵的展开见 <a href=\"../the-bit-and-entropy/the-concept-of-entropy\">信息熵的概念</a>｜作为代表作见 <a href=\"../../major-works/the-1948-paper/a-mathematical-theory-of-communication\">代表作·一九四八年论文</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>来源</strong>：Shannon, <em>A Mathematical Theory of Communication</em>, BSTJ 27 (1948), pp. 379–423, 623–656；Shannon &amp; Weaver, <em>The Mathematical Theory of Communication</em> (Univ. of Illinois Press, 1949)；<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shannon%E2%80%93Hartley_theorem\">Shannon–Hartley theorem, Wikipedia</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>论文骨架由三件东西咬合：通用通信模型、熵这个度量、两条极限定理。</li>\n<li>先定尺、再求极限：熵给出可压缩下限，容量给出可靠传输上限，中间即工程空间。</li>\n<li>英语熵的实算（约 1.0–1.5 比特/字母、冗余约 73%）第一次把「冗余」变成可算的百分比。</li>\n<li>强大来自「剥离语义」，边界也在这里：它不回答信息是否有意义、是否为真。</li>\n<li>反模式：把熵高当有用、跳过框图直奔公式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"《通信的数学理论》","id":"通信的数学理论"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一张图：通信系统的通用模型","id":"一张图-通信系统的通用模型"},{"level":2,"text":"论文的四块骨架","id":"论文的四块骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"两条定理：下限与上限","id":"两条定理-下限与上限"},{"level":2,"text":"一个数字例子：英语的熵","id":"一个数字例子-英语的熵"},{"level":2,"text":"为何是「划时代」：一篇论文的杠杆","id":"为何是-划时代-一篇论文的杠杆"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与定位","id":"反模式与定位"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"信息论之父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/founding-information-theory/the-father-of-information-theory"},"next":{"title":"度量信息","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/claude-shannon/core-contributions/the-bit-and-entropy/quantifying-information"}}